{"qid": "2wikimqa:f11ac580e22d7d0e3da7cf1c725c8def8aef4aa891baa07a", "question": "Which country Nizar Al-Mustafa's father is from?", "answers": ["Fatimid caliphate"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on the retrieved information, **Nizar al-Mustafa's father was from Egypt**. \n\nHis father was **al-Mustansir** (r. 1036–1094), the eighth Fatimid caliph and eighteenth Isma'ili imam, who ruled from Cairo, Egypt. Nizar was born in 1045 to al-Mustansir and was the oldest son of the Fatimid caliph[3][5].", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 50857.0, "error": ""}
