{"qid": "2wikimqa:d7f6203bfe33e28a517ed4214f515fb80671c48edd4720a6", "question": "Which film has the director who was born first, Perdón, Viejita or Smokey And The Bandit?", "answers": ["Perdón, Viejita"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "I have the information needed to answer this question.\n\n**Perdón, Viejita** was directed by **José A. Ferreyra**, who was born on **28 August 1889** in Buenos Aires, Argentina[3].\n\n**Smokey and the Bandit** was directed by **Hal Needham**, who was born on **6 March 1931**[7].\n\nComparing their birth dates, José A. Ferreyra (born 1889) was born 42 years before Hal Needham (born 1931).\n\n**Answer: Perdón, Viejita** has the director who was born first.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 22882.0, "error": ""}
