{"qid": "hotpotqa:7d3bc2e36b406094cb586b4eeb07f13a7f1ac9dfbdce7d1f", "question": "Which composer was wrote his music most recently, Michael Tippett or Luigi Cherubini?", "answers": ["Michael Kemp Tippett"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on general musical knowledge:\n\n- **Michael Tippett** (1905–1998) was a 20th-century British composer who wrote his music in the **modern era** (active roughly 1930s–1980s).\n\n- **Luigi Cherubini** (1760–1842) was an Italian composer who wrote his music in the **Classical and early Romantic era** (active late 1700s–early 1800s).\n\n**Michael Tippett** wrote his music more recently, working roughly 150 years after Cherubini.", "tool_calls": [], "latency_ms": 35153.9, "error": ""}
