{"qid": "musique:0f4da7d5be33010bcfb9197d3d910cc40bb8abc0ecc3bd32", "question": "Who played the girlfriend of who plays marty mcfly's daughter in back to the future 2?", "answers": ["Claudia Wells"], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "I found that Michael J. Fox played both Marty McFly and his daughter **Marlene McFly** in Back to the Future Part II[1]. Now the question asks who played the girlfriend of that person (Michael J. Fox's character Marty McFly). His girlfriend/wife Jennifer Parker was played by **Elisabeth Shue** in Part II[4].\n\nSo to answer the question: **Elisabeth Shue** played the girlfriend of Marty McFly (i.e., Jennifer Parker) in Back to the Future Part II[2][4]. Since Michael J. Fox played both Marty McFly and his daughter Marlene McFly, Elisabeth Shue played the girlfriend of the same actor who played Marty's daughter.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 24497.3, "error": ""}
