{"qid": "musique:074cbee8a17dcc448865addb33f8269d21c814d1c0b73e84", "question": "The all time top goal scorer in premier league in one season is a member of what team?", "answers": ["Egypt national football team"], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "The all-time top goal scorer in a single Premier League season is **Erling Haaland**, who scored **36 goals** in the 2022–23 season. He is a member of **Manchester City**.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 50679.8, "error": ""}
