{"qid": "hotpotqa:7e525340152c2f4b26d7fba85c680dde7b75af77356a7c22", "question": "Whiich genus has more species, Dracula or Pistacia?", "answers": ["Dracula"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on the knowledge base:\n\n*   The genus **Dracula** consists of **118 species**[2].\n*   The genus **Pistacia** contains **10 to 20 species**[7].\n\nTherefore, the genus **Dracula** has more species.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 17175.9, "error": ""}
{"qid": "hotpotqa:26a5366c80c3a569c474a3990f3383beb125d34149e8ed3e", "question": "Robbie Tucker plays in what series that follows a group of friends who run an Irish bar?", "answers": ["It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on the retrieved information, Robbie Tucker appears in **It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia**, which follows a group of self-centered friends (known as \"The Gang\") who run an Irish bar called Paddy's Pub in Philadelphia[2]. The series stars Charlie Day, Glenn Howerton, and Rob McElhenney, among others, and is known for its dark humor and the characters' often morally questionable antics while managing the bar[2].", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 29557.3, "error": ""}
{"qid": "hotpotqa:3056e292ff1583fe84207873be57c6ec28c28b425087ca84", "question": "Charles Haughey held what position when he dissolved the list of members who were elected to the lower house of the Oireachtas of Ireland on 25 May 1989?", "answers": ["Taoiseach of Ireland"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Charles Haughey held the position of **Taoiseach** (Irish Prime Minister) when the 25th Dáil was dissolved on 25 May 1989[2]. According to the evidence, \"The 25th Dáil was dissolved by President Patrick Hillery on 25 May 1989, at the request of the Taoiseach Charles Haughey\"[2]. At the time, Haughey was serving his third term as Taoiseach, having been in office since March 1987[4].", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 13982.9, "error": ""}
