{"qid": "hotpotqa:99635fd2d7a227cb3360253cf0f5759ed87bbac33593d830", "question": "Which mountain is higher, Tongshanjiabu or Himalchuli?", "answers": ["Himalchuli has three main peaks: East (7893 m), West (7540 m) and North (7371 m)"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "**Himalchuli** is higher.\n\nBased on the retrieved information:\n\n- **Himalchuli**'s highest peak (East) stands at **7,893 m (25,886 ft)**[6].\n- **Tongshanjiabu** stands at **7,207 m (23,645 ft)**[11].\n\nHimalchuli is approximately 686 meters (about 2,250 feet) taller than Tongshanjiabu.", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 100125.7, "error": ""}
