{"qid": "hotpotqa:3df75e9b85781f83af8d3011cedb0c5fc6725f3489e48e54", "question": "What occupation is shared by both Marge Piercy and Richard Aldington?", "answers": ["poet"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Both Marge Piercy and Richard Aldington share the occupation of being **writers**. Specifically, they are both authors who have written novels and poetry[8]. Richard Aldington was described as \"an English writer and poet\" whose 50-year writing career covered poetry, novels, criticism, and biography[8], while Marge Piercy was an American author known for novels and poetry.", "tool_calls": ["kb_wiki_lookup", "kb_wiki_lookup", "knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 18221.4, "error": ""}
{"qid": "hotpotqa:6d8f9be94b67277442c42aa9b437edaf901efec0d0959bda", "question": "Are both Duke Energy and Affiliated Managers Group based in Massachusetts?", "answers": ["no"], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "No, they are not both based in Massachusetts.\n\n- **Duke Energy** is headquartered in **Charlotte, North Carolina**[1].\n- **Affiliated Managers Group** has principal offices in several locations, including **Prides Crossing, Massachusetts**, as well as West Palm Beach, Florida; Stamford, Connecticut; and London, UK. It was originally founded in Boston, Massachusetts in 1993[6].", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 21311.8, "error": ""}
