{"qid": "hotpotqa:dc14a859291c1d678432626f6f7974f8ecca536f4b7bdd6c", "question": "Who was born later, Jerry Garcia or Joe Gooch?", "answers": ["Joe Gooch"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "**Joe Gooch** was born later. Here are the relevant facts:\n\n- **Jerry Garcia** was born on **August 1, 1942** [3][4].\n- **Joe Gooch** was born on **May 3, 1977** [6].\n\nThat makes Joe Gooch born about 35 years after Jerry Garcia.", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 20764.9, "error": ""}
{"qid": "hotpotqa:e9b828ee7169d1978f3bcb6de5bbb0f54f9ee3bfc0ffdb8b", "question": "National Firearms Agreement was in response to the Port Arthur massacre that killed how many people?", "answers": ["35 people"], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "The Port Arthur massacre, which occurred on 28 April 1996, resulted in **35 deaths** and 23 injuries. This tragedy led to the adoption of the National Firearms Agreement in Australia【1】.", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "kb_wiki_lookup"], "latency_ms": 29966.7, "error": ""}
