{"qid": "hotpotqa:f2da37b927d3f8ce752b69d7149a6eb31aa738d123f8fdb6", "question": "Which artist is known for his work on Marvel Team-Up and Batman: Son of the Demon?", "answers": ["Gerald \"Jerry\" Joseph Bingham, Jr."], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "The artist known for his work on both Marvel Team-Up and Batman: Son of the Demon is **Bernie Wrightson** (1948–2017). Wrightson was a legendary comic book artist and penciller celebrated for his detailed, atmospheric style, and he made notable contributions to both Marvel and DC Comics during his career.", "tool_calls": [], "latency_ms": 4386.3, "error": ""}
