{"qid": "musique:ce2f0aec72fade99a1be4add19d9e6364caf398a4586c902", "question": "Who wrote the song turn me on that is performed by performer of Feelin' the Same Way?", "answers": ["John D. Loudermilk"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Based on my research, **\"Turn Me On\"** was written by **John D. Loudermilk**[7].\n\nHere's the chain of reasoning:\n1. \"Feelin' the Same Way\" is performed by **Norah Jones**[3]\n2. \"Turn Me On\" was written by **John D. Loudermilk**, first recorded by Mark Dinning in 1961[7]\n3. Norah Jones later recorded her version of \"Turn Me On\" as a single from her debut album *Come Away with Me* in 2003[7]", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 43194.0, "error": ""}
