{"qid": "musique:19e28bddd1e5817780ebfba2ff23817578fb6e01289caa3a", "question": "Where is the country with ISO code ISO 3166-2:CV located?", "answers": ["central Atlantic Ocean", "Atlantic Ocean", "Atlantic"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "The ISO code **ISO 3166-2:CV** refers to **Cape Verde** (Cabo Verde). It is an archipelago country located in the **Atlantic Ocean**, approximately **570 km (350 mi) off the western coast of the African continent**, near Senegal, The Gambia, and Mauritania. It lies between latitudes 14° and 18°N, and longitudes 22° and 26°W, and is part of the **Macaronesia** ecoregion[7].", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 74732.1, "error": ""}
