{"qid": "musique:d51c30bc9bcc9c9daace1edac5bc07ded7df39ad346f4c04", "question": "The BBC Footballer of the Year is a member of which team?", "answers": ["Egypt national football team"], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "Based on the knowledge base results, the **BBC Footballer of the Year** (specifically the **BBC African Footballer of the Year**) mentioned in the context is **Callum McManaman**, who is associated with **Wigan Athletic**[6]. \n\nHe has also been linked to other clubs including West Bromwich Albion[7][8] and Sunderland[10].", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 79581.8, "error": ""}
