{"qid": "musique:1f2d53ab7c6e9f6ae863e4bedf1091966ccc1cfb68374b35", "question": "The city that Psycho Donuts is located in is in which county?", "answers": ["Santa Clara County", "Santa Clara County, California"], "status": "ok", "correct": true, "answer": "Psycho Donuts is located in **Campbell, California**[1], which is in **Santa Clara County**[8].", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 23775.8, "error": ""}
{"qid": "2wikimqa:8af3f07b73fabc0cc4ef4e6928818d1ff08ead9f41a5085a", "question": "Are Ding Yaping and Johann Christian Gustav Lucae of the same nationality?", "answers": ["yes"], "status": "ok", "correct": false, "answer": "Based on the search results, **yes, Ding Yaping and Johann Christian Gustav Lucae share the same nationality — German**[1][6].\n\n- **Ding Yaping** (born 1967) is a Chinese-born former international table tennis player who **later represented Germany**, giving her German nationality[1].\n- **Johann Christian Gustav Lucae** (1814–1885) was a **German** anatomist born and died in Frankfurt am Main[6].\n\nSo while Ding Yaping has a dual Chinese-German background, both individuals are German.", "tool_calls": ["knowledge_base_search", "knowledge_base_search"], "latency_ms": 39902.8, "error": ""}
